OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval castle goes up for sale
OL,4,Afor #5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA castle where King Henry VIII and Anne
OL,7,FBoleyn are said to have dined - which
OL,8,Fcomes with its own moat, bear-baiting
OL,9,Fring and jousting yard - is on sale for
OL,10,F#5m.
OL,12,FAllington Castle, near Maidstone, Kent,
OL,13,Fis a restored 12th Century building set
OL,14,Fin about 42 acres of woodland and
OL,15,Friverside grounds next to the River
OL,16,FMedway.
OL,18,FSir Robert Worcester, the US-born
OL,19,Ffounder of polling company Mori, lived
OL,20,Fin the castle from the late-1990s but
OL,21,Fhe died in 2025 and the property has
OL,22,Fnow been put up for sale.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
