OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval castle goes up for sale
OL,4,Afor #5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FOli Streeter, from estate agent Knight
OL,7,FFrank, said the family were "looking
OL,8,Ffor the next custodian... to take on
OL,9,FAllington for the next 20, 30, 40
OL,10,Fyears, just like Sir Robert".
